# Unit03
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit03核心词汇

angle/ˈæŋɡl/角度；观点/Let's look at the problem from a different angle.
angry/ˈæŋɡri/生气的；愤怒的/She was angry about the unfair treatment.
animal/ˈænɪml/动物/The zoo has many rare animals.
ankle/ˈæŋkl/脚踝/He twisted his ankle while running.
anniversary/ˌænɪˈvɜːrsəri/周年纪念日/They celebrated their wedding anniversary.
announce/əˈnaʊns/宣布；宣告/The company announced a new product launch.
annoy/əˈnɔɪ/使恼怒；使烦恼/Loud noise annoys me very much.
annual/ˈænjuəl/年度的；每年的/The annual report shows good results.
anonymous/əˈnɑːnɪməs/匿名的/He received an anonymous letter.
another/əˈnʌðər/另一个；又一个/Would you like another cup of coffee?
answer/ˈænsər/回答；答案/She gave a quick answer to the question.
anxiety/æŋˈzaɪəti/焦虑；不安/He suffers from anxiety and depression.
anxious/ˈæŋkʃəs/焦虑的；渴望的/She is anxious about the exam results.
any/ˈeni/任何的/Any student can join the club.
apart/əˈpɑːrt/分开地；相隔地/The two cities are 100 miles apart.
apartment/əˈpɑːrtmənt/公寓；套房/She lives in a small apartment downtown.
apologize/əˈpɑːlədʒaɪz/道歉/He apologized for being late.
apology/əˈpɑːlədʒi/道歉；歉意/He made a sincere apology to her.
apparent/əˈpærənt/明显的；表面上的/It was apparent that she was lying.
appeal/əˈpiːl/呼吁；吸引力/The idea has great appeal to young people.
appear/əˈpɪr/出现；似乎/A rainbow appeared in the sky after the rain.
appetite/ˈæpɪtaɪt/食欲；胃口/The long walk gave me a good appetite.
apple/ˈæpl/苹果/An apple a day keeps the doctor away.
apply/əˈplaɪ/申请；应用/She applied for a scholarship last month.
appoint/əˈpɔɪnt/任命；指定/He was appointed as the new manager.
appreciate/əˈpriːʃieɪt/感激；欣赏/I really appreciate your help.
approach/əˈproʊtʃ/接近；方法/We need a new approach to this problem.
appropriate/əˈproʊpriət/适当的；合适的/This is not an appropriate time for jokes.
approve/əˈpruːv/批准；赞成/The committee approved the new plan.
approximate/əˈprɑːksɪmət/近似的；大约的/The approximate cost is 1000 dollars.
area/ˈeriə/地区；领域/This area is famous for its beautiful scenery.
argue/ˈɑːrɡjuː/争论；主张/They argued about the best solution.
arise/əˈraɪz/出现；产生/Problems may arise during the process.
arm/ɑːrm/手臂；武器/She held the baby in her arms.
army/ˈɑːrmi/军队；陆军/He joined the army when he was 18.
around/əˈraʊnd/周围；大约/The children played around the garden.
arrange/əˈreɪndʒ/安排；整理/She arranged the flowers in a vase.
arrest/əˈrest/逮捕；阻止/The police arrested the thief last night.
arrival/əˈraɪvl/到达；到来/Upon arrival at the airport, he called a taxi.
arrive/əˈraɪv/到达；抵达/The train arrived at the station on time.
arrow/ˈæroʊ/箭；箭头/He shot an arrow at the target.
art/ɑːrt/艺术；技术/She has a great talent for art.
article/ˈɑːrtɪkl/文章；条款/He wrote an article for the newspaper.
artificial/ˌɑːrtɪˈfɪʃl/人造的；人工的/Artificial intelligence is changing our lives.
aside/əˈsaɪd/在旁边；到旁边/She stepped aside to let him pass.
ask/æsk/问；请求/Can I ask you a question?
asleep/əˈsliːp/睡着的/The baby is fast asleep.
aspect/ˈæspekt/方面；角度/We need to consider every aspect of the problem.
assemble/əˈsembl/集合；组装/The students assembled in the hall.
assess/əˈses/评估；评价/We need to assess the situation carefully.
assign/əˈsaɪn/分配；指派/The teacher assigned homework to the students.
assist/əˈsɪst/帮助；协助/Can you assist me with this project?
assume/əˈsuːm/假设；承担/Don't assume that everyone agrees with you.
assure/əˈʃʊr/保证；使确信/I assure you that everything will be fine.
atmosphere/ˈætməsfɪr/气氛；大气层/The atmosphere in the room was tense.
attach/əˈtætʃ/附上；重视/Please attach your photo to the application form.
attack/əˈtæk/攻击；发作/The army launched an attack at dawn.
attain/əˈteɪn/达到；获得/She attained the highest score in the class.
attempt/əˈtempt/尝试；企图/He attempted to climb the mountain.
attend/əˈtend/出席；照料/She attended the conference last week.
